3,241]},{"id_str":"1736606949926371328","screen_name":"aryankumar877","name":"Aryan","indices":[252,266]}]},"extended_entities":{"media":[{"type":"photo","media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLMHX57a8AABP5-.jpg","url":"https://t.co/qEYtgmmHjF"}]},"media":[{"type":"photo","media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLMHX57a8AABP5-.jpg","url":"https://t.co/qEYtgmmHjF"}]}},{"id":"2106381994557096320","url":"https://x.com/vesper792/status/2106381994557096320","text":"of hooks & hookrs. \nwho's shipping hooks on solanahood chain? \n\nrobinhood v4 hooks\n@hookrfun has been making things interesting on robinhood chain, using uniswap v4 hooks to give pools custom fees, LP rewards & a pot for every nth qualifying buy. \n\nsolana token-22 transfer hooks\nover on solana, @Hoookedpad has a different box of toys. \n\npermissionlessly powered by meteora's dynamic bonding curves, hooked uses token-2022 transfer hooks to give tokens their own rules. \n\ne.g. buyers might need to hold another token to get in, face a cap on wallet holdings, or have their tokens unlock gradually.\n\nlaunchers can get creative with where people trade, too: \nfomo-only buys, buying routes used by the pump app, or a social-trading mode that recognises both. \n& dev just shipped an opensea-only rule!\n\nendless possibilities\nimagine launching for your existing community, where holding its token gets you through the door. \nor building a launch around the app your traders hang out on. \n- rules on distribution now become a core part of the token launch game.\n\nkey difference between v4 hooks & transfer hooks?\ndifferent tools give builders different opportunities: hookr changes the pool’s rules; hooked puts checks on the token’s transfers. \n\n\"solana vs robinhood chain\" is getting spicy.\nthis is the competition i love to see!\nbuilders experimenting, traders getting new tools to play with, everyone pushing onchain finance forward.\n\na rising tide lifts all bags 💸\n\nbuilders will win. m